# Cloudflare Pages Caching & Security Headers for TerraData

# Next.js immutable static assets (fingerprinted js/css/media)
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Local Leaflet stylesheet (stable filename)
/leaflet.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

# Global default security & performance headers
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
